# Low Work RAM, first look (2026-11-16): booted on the entry roof (0800: row 8, column 0, the page
# 0x0028_0000), turned round slowly, then a run south off the entry into the maze. Read the debug
# line: fps, vdp1 over N/T, px if a profiler build, and "at" the page you stand on
boot_at 0800
wait_up
wait 1.5
shot lr1_00
hold left 0.5
wait 0.4
shot lr1_01
hold left 0.5
wait 0.4
shot lr1_02
hold left 0.5
wait 0.4
shot lr1_03
hold left 0.5
wait 0.4
shot lr1_04
keydown up
wait 0.5
shot lr1_05
wait 0.5
shot lr1_06
wait 0.5
shot lr1_07
keyup up
wait 1.0
shot lr1_08
